window.products.push({"id":75005,"name":"Anlyter 30 Inch Gas Cooktop, 5 Burners Built-in Gas Stovetop Stainless Steel LPG/NG Gas Stove Dual Fuel Sealed Gas Hob with Wok Stand and Pressure Reg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":268.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hUfyVXnNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【Versatile Heat Output Burners】The gas stove offers 5 different versatile burner sizes: a triple ring 11262BTU(3.3KW) burner, semi-rapid 9385BTU (2.75KW) burner, two5972BTU(1.75KW) burners and an auxiliary 3413BTU(1.0KW) burner. This stove is very suitable for many forms of cooking. It can be used for boiling, searing, frying pan and stir-frying, etc. And the burner can provide the high and low heat required for cooking, and provide the required heat for delicate dishes. ★【Safety Performance】It features a a safe electronic ignition system and make the ignition very easy. ★【Premium Quality And Durable】Made of 100% stainless steel, with heavy cast iron grate and anti-melting metal knobs, and the stove surface is very easy to clean and maintain. If you want to clean stove surface and the grate, just remove the cast iron grate and wipe it easily with a soft cloth with water or detergent. ★【Easy To Install】The installation steps of this drop-in stainless steel gas cooker are quick and easy. It is pre-installed with a 110V power cord and has an automatic ignition function. The package includes a wok support ring, which makes the pot easy to operate and to match different cooking styles. ★【Easy To Use】Each burner is individually controlled by a knob to automatically ignite, and has a one-second rapid ignition system. The stove is pre-installed with natural gas nozzles, and the package includes an LPG conversion kit.(Propane Nozzle can be changed to meet your needs). And the regulator suitable for NG and LPG are offered for free. ▶(Notice: The gas cooktop offers 1-year warranty.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hUfyVXnNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anlyter","source_asin":"B0B18XM3FB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B18XM3FB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B18XM3FB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":75006,"name":"Nictemaw Washing Machine 17.6lbs Portalbe Washer and Dryer Combo 2-in-1 Compact Twin Tub Laundry Washer with Built-in Drain Pump 11lbs Washer and 6.6l","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M7v3dZpYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👖Twin Tubs Design -- Our portable washing machine features 2 separate tubs for washing and spin drying, allowing you to move clothes between the two or run both simultaneously. This design saves you valuable time and energy, making laundry a breeze 👖Superior Quality Motor -- Our washing machine is equipped with a powerful motor that provides excellent cleaning power, allowing you to wash your clothes quickly and efficiently without damaging them. The efficient spin dryer can remove 97% of the water quickly, leaving your clothes almost dry after washing. With 240W washing power and 140W spin power, this machine ensures continuous output for a thorough and effective clean every time 👖Large Capacity -- Portable washer dryer combo boasts a total capacity of 17.6lbs, with a rated washing capacity of 11lbs and a rated spinner dryer capacity of 6.6lbs, can handle all your laundry needs in one go, saving your time and worry 👖Semi-Automatic Design -- This washer and dryer combo is designed with flexible time control that brings you a lot of convenience and options in laundry. You can set the washer timer to 15 minutes and the spin timer to 5 minutes per load, allowing you to customize the washing time according to the type of clothes you're washing. Effectively saving energy, safe and durable, and you don't have to worry about high electricity bills 👖Reliable After-Sales Service -- Our goal is to ensure your satisfaction with our products. If you encounter any issues with the washer and dryer combo, our customer service team is available 24/7 to assist you. We provide a 2-year warranty and offer a full refund within 30 days of purchase. Thank you for choosing our products and trusting us with your laundry needs. NOTE: This portable washing machine equipped with SPINNING FUNCTION, but NOT a drying function","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M7v3dZpYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nictemaw","source_asin":"B0BV8XJCFJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV8XJCFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV8XJCFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
