window.products.push({"id":75224,"name":"CAFEC Abaca trapezoid paper filter for 3-5 cups 100pcs/pack |Disposable Pour-Over Drip Coffee Paper Filter made of Eco-Friendly Refined Virgin Pulp fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BBbWMkMFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"There are many kinds of coffee filter paper in markets, but it would be a big mistake if you think it is just a paper and there is not much difference even if which paper you use. Our CAFEC filter paper has “Two-Side Crepe”. Though another normal paper has crepe on one-side only but the CAFEC paper keeps Two-Side Crepe by our original papermaking technology (Air-through dry). In normal papermaking process, paper is dried on a heating roller so crepe on one side is pressed down. On the other hand, CAFEC paper added crepe on both sides dried by hot blast, not pressed on a heater, so the crepe on both sides of paper can be kept as it is and enough height of crepe is maintained. [AB102-100W] 102 (for 3-5cups) 100pcs/pack, 80packs/ctn","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BBbWMkMFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAFEC","source_asin":"B08MVXW8JR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MVXW8JR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MVXW8JR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
