window.products.push({"id":75383,"name":"GENUINE Frigidaire 131553900 Heater Assembly for Dryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":102.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ce9geKq2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Be sure to keep up on laundry when you install this replacement heating element assembly from Frigidaire. This appliance repair piece is compatible with a variety of dryer models. As a genuine Frigidaire replacement part, this motor will help your appliance run smoothly to get your clothes perfectly dry. From the Manufacturer Frigidaire 131553900 Heater Assembly for Dryer. Heating Element Assembly. Part number 131553900. Genuine replacement part.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ce9geKq2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRIGIDAIRE","source_asin":"B002ZNN8CW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002ZNN8CW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B002ZNN8CW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":75384,"name":"Waterdrop Plus UKF7003 Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Maytag UKF7003, UKF7002AXX, Whirlpool EDR7D1, UKF7003AXX, UKF7002, 7003AXXP, UKF7001","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QrdgWG45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Authoritative Certifications] Dedicated to providing pure and healthy drinking water, Waterdrop, a world-famous water purification brand, has been trusted by over 6 million American families. Waterdrop's high-quality replacement filters, from every component to the whole filter, have been certified by NSF and IAPMO against NSF/ANSI 401, 53, 42, and 372 standards for effective reduction of 29 substances, ensuring high-quality drinking water. [Comprehensive Certifications] This filter has been strictly certified against NSF/ANSI 401 for reduction of 99.2% of bisphenol A , phenytoin, estrone, ibuprofen and naproxen and against NSF/ANSI 53 for reduction of 99.99% of cyst. It is certified by IAPMO for reduction of 20 harmful substances like 99.59% of ethylbenzene, over 99% of trimethoprim, 2,4 D, lindane，MTBE and atrazine. Furthermore, it can reduce PFOA and PFOS according to testing. [Deep filtration] Waterdrop's refrigerator filters significantly reduce the levels of many different harmful substances in your water. The filter additionally allows through many of the beneficial minerals in water that are essential for health. [Fast water flow, no leaks] Our mission is to supply refrigerator water filters that fit perfectly, impeccably engineered; this sets us apart from inferior models of replacement filters that can frequently result in water leakage problems. The microscopic pore sizes in our filter cartridges, made of superior materials, allow for smooth running, crisp, pure water. [Carefully chosen materials] Waterdrop uses coconut shell carbon blocks supplied from Sri Lanka that have enlarged surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon blocks. The filter cartridge is far more effective in reducing levels of chlorine, dirt, sediment, rust, and a wide range of heavy metals tested by a third-party laboratory. We have chosen a BPA-free and food-grade housing for the filter that exceeds the NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. [Regular filter changes] If you run replacement filter past the recommended date, pollutants could accumulate and filtration performance could suffer. Because of this, we supply a complimentary set of installation stickers with every filter so that you can see at a glance when it needs replacing. We recommend that you should replace your filter after it has been used for 4800 cups of water (300 gallons) or 6 months (this may vary dependent on the water condition in your area). [Professional standards] Our expert teams pride themselves on not letting any product or part of a product, down to the smallest components, leave our factory unless we are satisfied that they have reached and exceeded the very highest market standards. Our dedication doesn't just apply within the factory: we have a customer service team ready to answer your questions and deal with any problems 24/7. [More than just a business] Waterdrop is passionate about providing clean water for as many people as possible with lower environmental impact. We use cowhide corrugated box packaging, reducing the wastage other companies create with their materials. A percentage of the purchase price from every one of our filters is used to fund projects providing clean, pure water for African children who don't have access to safe water supplies. [Replacement for models] UKF7003, EDR7D1, UKF7003AXX, UKF7001AXX, UKF7002AXX, UKF6001AXX, UKF5001AXX, UKF7003T, UKF7003P, Tier1 RWF1041, WF288, R-7003, SP-WP700, EFF-6014A, WSM-1, EveryDrop by Whirlpool EDR7D1, AQF-FF14, IP ‎RWF1600A, ‎RWF1600A-S, CLCH115, ‎CLCH115-S, PURELINE PL-2600, PP-RWF1600A, RFC1600A, Aqua Fresh WF288, SGF-M07, FMM-1, PUR-15, RB-M2, Denali Pure WF-UKF7003, EveryDrop EDR7D1B, FILTER 7, WD-F14, WDP-F14. [Compatible with] JCD2389GES, MZD2766GES, JCD2389DEB, JCD2389DEQ, JCD2389DES, JCD2389DEW, JCD2389DTB, JCD2389DTW, JCD2389GEB, JCD2389GEQ, JCD2389GEW, JCD2389GTB, JCD2389GTW, JSD2789ATW, JSD2789DEB, JSD2789DEQ, JSD2789DES, JSD2789DEW, JSD2789GEB, JSD2789GEQ, JSD2789GES, JSD2789GEW, JSD2789HES, MSD2454GRW, MSD2756DEQ, MSD2756DEW, MSD2756GEB, MZD2752GR, MZD2752GRB, MZD2752GRQ, MZD2752GRS, MZD2752GRW, MZD2766GEW, MZD2766GEB, MZD2766GEQ.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QrdgWG45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01CC7UIH8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CC7UIH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CC7UIH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":75385,"name":"TOP-HEATER 235210(WB30X359) 6” Electric Range Burner Element For GE Hotpoint RCA Stove Coil Surface Element Replace AH244055, EA244055, PM30X0120, PM3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J21ucW9CS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【REPLACE PART NUMBER】Our 6’’ surface burner element WB30X359 fits most brand electric range stoves including GE, Hotpoint, RCA etc. Replaces for 2637, AH244055, EA244055, PM30X0120, PM30X120, PS244055, WB30X0359, WB30X359, WB30X359R and matches 8’’ range burner WB30X348 【MATERIAL】WB30X359 electric range burner element is made of stainless steel 321. Compared with stainless steel 304, stainless steel 321 is added the composition of titanium, which has higher temperature resistance, stronger oxidation resistance, better wear resistance and lower deformation during electric stove burners working 【DESIGN】1.Easy to install 2.Our range element adopts new seal process which is sealed with Teflon caps and shrinking at the two ends.Compared with the old seal process, which is sealed with silicone caps and without shrinking, the new seal process ensures surface element a longer service life,improves safety and avoids the leakage caused by damp though it’s not used for a long time 3.If the range burner does not sit flat on your stove,make the prong heads are parallel and push a bit down 【STRENGTH】UL listed. Our electric stove burner elements had been approved by UL. We TOP-HEATER have more than 30 years experiences in the production of electric heating element. We can manufacture various types of products based on different customers designs with better quality and higher safety 【WHAT YOU GET】1 pcs 6\" Electric Range Burner Element WB30X359 – 5-Turns ,208V 1000W, 240V 1325W. Please check the dimensions shown in the picture 7 to ensure the range burner element fit your electric stove. If you are not sure about it, please feel free to email us to confirm compatibility. We will reply you in the first time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J21ucW9CS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOP-HEATER","source_asin":"B09QT7G332","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QT7G332","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QT7G332","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
