window.products.push({"id":75467,"name":"2 X Purity Pro PF01 LG Refrigerator Replacement Filter for LG LT700P, ADQ36006101, ADQ36006102, Kenmore 46-9690 and 9690","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i1ZyEsGYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protect your family with a higher standard filter than other compatibles in the market. Made using Advanced Concentrated Carbon Technology, Water Tree Filters are NSF 42 Certified for Quality Materials and Structural Integrity which means they won't let you down when you need it the most. Normally most compatible filters just remove Chlorine, Taste and Odor but our filters retain a much higher carbon surface area, increasing the components life and allowing more harmful contaminants to be removed from the water and bond to the carbon. This Filter is a direct replacement for the following refrigerator filter model numbers: LG LT700P, ADQ36006101, ADQ36006101-S, ADQ36006101S, ADQ36006102, ADQ36006102-S, ADQ36006102S, 048231783705, ADQ36006101, 9690, 46-9690. The Science: Unlike most refrigerator filters that lose up to 58% filtration efficiency due to clogging, our unique Concentrated Coconut Activated Carbon Refrigerator Filters are mixed, sinterized and compressed using advanced patented Celanese® resin. With an atomic mass of 3 million~10 million u, this Ultra High Molecular Weight Polyethylene (UHMWPE) resin retains a much higher carbon surface area, increasing the components life and allowing more harmful contaminants to be removed from the water and bond to the carbon. Compared to refrigerator filters that use standard thermoplastic resin as a binding agent in the extruded process, our filters retain 98% filtration efficiency for the life span of the filter, making them one of the most efficient in the market.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i1ZyEsGYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purity Pro","source_asin":"B01EMB5I4K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EMB5I4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EMB5I4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
