window.products.push({"id":75587,"name":"W10780045 Washer Suspension Rod Kit (26.7 inches) For Amana Whirlpool Kenmore Maytag Washing Machine NTW4516FW0, WTW4616FW0, 11020102310, W10537442 wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BWyDIIQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"W10780045 Washer Suspension Rod Kit - Stainless Steel ❤【COST EFFECTIVE GOODS】- Package includes 4 x W10780045 suspension rod, 4 x suspension balls and 4 x suspension ball housing. The W10780045 suspension rod kit contains all the required replacement parts to complete the standard installation of your washer. These rod/spring assemblies are approximately 26.7 inches in length. The suspension rods help dampen the movement of the washer tub. If one or more of the suspension rods are broken, the washer will vibrate or shake ❤【WIDE APPLICATION】- W10780045 washer suspension rod kit is perfectly compatible with Whirlpool, Amana, Jenn Air, Kenmore, Maytag, Roper and Admiral washing machines. W10780045 directly replaces W10537442, W10537443, W10622030, W10645652, W10748953, W10748955, W10780045VP, W10780053, W10821951, W10821956, 4282746, AP5971396, EAP11703288, PS11703288 (Contact us if you are not clear the models, and we are here to help within 24 hours) ❤【EXCELLENT PERFORMANCE】- W10780045 washer suspension rod kit supports the washing tub and balance the washing machine under unbalanced conditions to reduce vibration. It acts as a shock absorber that allows the washer tub to move while helping minimize vibration in the spin mode. If the washer loses balance or code error, use the damper to keep balance back to normal use. The unbalanced load error \"uL\" in cabrio style machines is often caused by faulty suspension ❤【PREMIUM QUALITY & EASY INSTALLATION】- Our whirlpool W10780045 washer suspension rod kit replacement is made of premium material well-tested by the manufacturer, with higher efficiency, adequate duribility and the best quality to meet OEM standards and keep a longer service life. ⚠️It is fairly easy to install. Before servicing, disconnect all power sources and wear work gloves to protect your hands. If you're not sure how to install it, please watch the related video on youtube to help you ❤【AFTER SALES SERVICE】 - Funmit is dedicated to giving all customers a simple, effective shopping experience for major appliance replacement parts in order to show that we have the best parts and service accessible. Please get in touch with the Funmit customer care staff as soon as possible if you have any quality issues, and we'll do everything we can to help","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BWyDIIQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funmit","source_asin":"B08BNVT3B9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BNVT3B9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BNVT3B9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
