window.products.push({"id":75596,"name":"9758079 Bake Oven Spark Igniter for Range (2023 UPGRADE) by Beaquicy - Replacement for Whirl-pool Ken-more May-tag A-mana Oven Range - Replaces WP9758","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T7EtumazL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【9758079 IGNITER】-- WP9758079 Bake Oven Spark Igniter is for range. It is a surface burner igniter, also known as a top burner igniter or cooktop spark electrode, the WP9758079 Whirlpool Oven Igniter is used to produce a spark or ignite for igniting oven burners or surface burners or some gas cooktop models with a DSI (direct spark ignition) system. Main colors are ceramic white and silver. Package includes 1 x 9758079 Oven Igniter. It is made of high quality materials, strong and durable. ✅【CERAMIC AND METAL】-- The WP9758079 Oven Igniter is made of high quality durable ceramic and metal. It has been designed and improved to be stable, durable and highly reliable. 9758079 Bake Oven Spark Igniter is a surface burner igniter with mounting bracket for some gas cooktops with direct spark ignition system. ►If igniter is broken, the range will have the following conditions, and the igniter need to be replaced in time: won't start, Very little heat, Igniter glows but does not ignite. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The 9758079 bake oven spark igniter support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ►The products are made of high quality materials, tested by the manufacturer, sturdy and durable and easy to install. When the valve is opened, the gas flows through the valve into the pipe and mixes with the air in the pipe to form a combustion mixture. The combustion mixture then flows into the burner, which is ignited by the spark igniter. Gas stoves using direct spark ignition systems require special attention to safety. ✅【SUITABLE FOR MANY BRANDS】--WP9758079 Bake Oven Spark Igniter replacement for Whirl-pool, Ken-more, May-tag, A-mana range stoves. Replaces part numbers WP9758079, 9758079, PD00002406, WP9758079VP, 1028462, AP6013984, PS11747217, EAP11747217, WEG515S0FS2, WEG515S0FV1, WFG525S0HV1, 66475113611, 66572163301, 66572163302, 66572164301, 66572164302, 66572169301, TGS325VB1, TGS325VB2, TGS325VT0, TGS325VT1, TGS325VT2, TGS326TD0, TGS326TD1, AGR6603SFB2, AGR6603SFS2, AGR6603SFW2, IGR660GS0, IGS790GS0, MGR6600FB1, MGR6600FW1, MGR6600FZ1, WEG515S0FB2, WEG515S0FV2, WEG515S0FW2, WFG510S0HB1, WFG510S0HW1, WFG525S0HB1, WFG525S0HS1, etc. ✅【EASY INSTALLATION】-- The installation of Bake Oven Spark Igniter 9758079 is simple. Before installation, please disconnect the power supply and put on working gloves to protect your hands. Locate the location where the ignition is located and use a screwdriver to remove the screw holding the ignition in place. Pull out the igniter. Insert the new igniter into the original position and secure it with the screw, making sure the igniter does not come off and wobble.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T7EtumazL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B082VNMJCP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082VNMJCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082VNMJCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
