window.products.push({"id":75703,"name":"Ca'Lefort 15'' Wine Cooler Refrigerator - 28 Bottle Wine Fridge Dual Zone with Modern Touch Intelligent Digital 40°-65°F Low Noise, Built in or Freest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":689.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pof-z316L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Built-in Precise Temperature Sensing Device】 Ca'Lefort wine cooler has a control temperature range between 40°F and 65°F without frost. It also includes a memory function that automatically restores the set temperature after a power outage and restoration. It cools quickly, from room temperature to a set temperature of less than 40 mins. 【Special Self-Test Temperature Function】Our beverage refrigerator or wine cooler can be tested for the actual temperature inside the fridge in a unique function. Customers only need to press and hold the \"Up Button\" of the temperature button on the control panel for 5 seconds. Then the digital intelligent control panel will display the actual temperature of the refrigerator. Generally, refrigerators are within 4°F (2°C) of temperature error. 【Super Quiet】The 15 Inch wine fridge was equipped with advanced cooling systems and circulation systems with energy saving, noise reduction, and vibration reduction functions. Its voltage and power are 115 volts and 104 watts respectively as well as its noise is less than 41 decibels. So its operation will not affect your daily life and rest. 【Available in Multiple Locations and Stainless Steel Front Vent】 Ca'Lefort wine cooler holds 28 wine bottles. The refrigerator can hold larger bottles on the top and bottom and it can be placed in the kitchen, bedroom, office, cafe, or restaurant for your family, colleagues and you to refrigerate champagne, red wine, rose wine, etc. It works anywhere there is a socket and is very easy to install. 【Use Reliable Materials】 Ca'Lefort 15 Inch wine refrigerator equipped with total 5 pcs removable carbonized wooden shelves it made the original charcoal roasting process. Retro, luxury, Eco-friendly, and accompanied natural wood smell. Let your red wine seem to back to ancient wine cellar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pof-z316L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ca'Lefort","source_asin":"B0BPSCFXZ9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSCFXZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSCFXZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
