window.products.push({"id":75740,"name":"3.0 Cu.Ft Compact Refrigerator with 2 Doors, Mini Fridge with Freezer, 37dB Quiet, 7-Settings Mechanical Thermostat, Small Refrigerator for Bedroom Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jGh5ocb0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥝3.0 𝐂𝐮.𝐅𝐓 𝐅𝐎𝐑 𝐒𝐏𝐀𝐂𝐈𝐎𝐔𝐒 𝐒𝐓𝐎𝐑𝐈𝐍𝐆: If you're looking for the perfect small refrigerator to preserve fresh fruits, vegetables or refrigerated drinks, the Frestec mini fridge for office with a compact size of 17.8*20.5*33.5\" will satisfy you in keeping all needs in order and fresh. Coming with 2-door design, our refrigerators have a separate 1 Cu.Ft freezer zone,which is roomy enough for your ice cream or frozen food in hot summer. ⚡𝐒𝐀𝐕𝐈𝐍𝐆 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐄𝐋𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐑𝐈𝐂𝐈𝐓𝐘 𝐁𝐈𝐋𝐋𝐒: Equipped with R600 a high-efficiency and low-consumption compressor, this dorm refrigerator only causes 0.69 kWh and $0.08 for a day to maintain the optimum humidity inside for your food, which is lower than most beverage fridge on the market. No matter where you are, our compact refrigerator operates smoothly and quietly at a minimum noise under the 37dB for better fitting in bedrooms, dorms and offices without occupying much space. ⚙7 𝐕𝐀𝐑𝐈𝐀𝐁𝐋𝐄 𝐓𝐄𝐌𝐏𝐄𝐑𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐄𝐒 𝐅𝐎𝐑 𝐕𝐀𝐑𝐈𝐎𝐔𝐒 𝐍𝐄𝐄𝐃𝐒: Thanks to the manually adjustable thermostat control that is from 1 (cold) to 7 (the coldest), our black mini fridge offers the optimum temperature range from 33.78-46.4℉ to store dairies, vegetables, fruits and beverages with a best status in different seasons or occasions. There are 4 adjustable legs to protect the fridge from getting wet. ❄𝐊𝐄𝐄𝐏 𝐀𝐋𝐋 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐕𝐄𝐍𝐈𝐄𝐍𝐂𝐄 𝐈𝐍 𝐌𝐈𝐍𝐃: Stop worrying about the hassle of cleaning the fridge. This compact refrigerator with freezer comes with 2 detachable glass shelves and a glass shelves for making your food organized the actual storage needs cleanup easily than ever. LED lighting makes it easy to search what you need at night. With the special reversible door design, it is friendly to accommodate both right and left-handed users. 💞𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐒𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐒𝐅𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐈𝐒 𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐏𝐑𝐈𝐎𝐑𝐈𝐓𝐘: RISK-FREE when purchasing from our store! We will provide a 100% satisfaction guarantee for our customers if there is any damage part when receive our 3.0 mini fridge. Please contact us and let us first,we will help you if your purchased product does not live up to your expectations :)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jGh5ocb0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frestec","source_asin":"B0C5MDWCBV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-75740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5MDWCBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5MDWCBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
